.TH FL-SCAN 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.4" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-scan \- scan documents and pictures
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-scan\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scans with SANE through \fBscanimage\fR(1). Pick a scanner, the colours
and the quality (resolution) and, if the scanner has one, the document
feeder. \fBPreview\fR scans the whole glass quickly; drag on the preview to
scan only that part. \fBScan\fR adds the page (from the feeder: every page)
to the list on the right, where pages can be reordered, removed and shown.
\fBSave\fR writes all pages as one PDF, or each page as a PNG picture.
.PP
Network scanners need the \fBsane-airscan\fR backend.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBscanimage\fR(1), \fBsane\fR(7)
